    "title": "When is the 2026 WNBA Draft? Indiana Fever selections, draft order, where to watch, start time",
    "text": "April 13, 2026, 9:00 a.m. ETThe Indiana Fever will add to their roster during the 2026 WNBA Draft on Monday, April 13.The Fever, who reached the WNBA semifinals in 2025 despite an avalanche of injuries, will build around a core of 2024 Rookie of the Year Caitlin Clark, three-time All-Star Aliyah Boston and 2025 first-team All-WNBA performer Kelsey Mitchell.The Fever are scheduled to pick 10th, 25th and 40th overall in the three-round event.When is the 2026 WNBA Draft? Start time for WNBA Draft 20267 p.m. ET Monday, April 13, 2026, in New York.What channel is the WNBA Draft on? How can I watch the 2026 WNBA Draft?TV: ESPNWNBA Orange Carpet Special, 5:30 p.m. ET on ESPN2WNBA Countdown, 6:30 p.m. ET, ESPNWatch the WNBA with a free Fubo trialWhen do the Indiana Fever pick in the 2026 WNBA Draft?First roundDallas WingsMinnesota Lynx (via Chicago Sky)Seattle Storm (via Los Angeles Sparks)Washington MysticsChicago Sky (via Connecticut Sun)Toronto TempoPortland FireGolden State ValkyriesWashington MysticsIndiana FeverWashington Mystics (via New York Liberty)Connecticut Sun (via Phoenix Mercury)Atlanta DreamSeattle Storm (via Las Vegas Aces)Connecticut Sun (via Minnesota Lynx)Second roundSeattle Storm (via Dallas Wings)Portland Fire (via Chicago Sky)Connecticut SunWashington MysticsLos Angeles SparksChicago Sky (via Portland Fire)Toronto TempoGolden State ValkyriesLos Angeles Sparks (via Seattle Storm)Indiana FeverToronto Tempo (via New York Liberty)Phoenix MercuryAtlanta DreamLas Vegas AcesWashington Mystics (via Minnesota Lynx)Third roundDallas WingsChicago SkyConnecticut SunWashington MysticsLos Angeles SparksToronto TempoPortland FireGolden State ValkyriesSeattle StormIndiana FeverNew York LibertyPhoenix MercuryAtlanta DreamLas Vegas AcesMinnesota LynxGet IndyStar's Indiana Fever and Caitlin Clark coverage sent directly to your inbox with our Caitlin Clark Fever newsletter. Subscribe to IndyStar's YouTube channel for Fever Insiders Live.Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
